      'Each placement says “According to [source]” and links to its paper or catalog. Catalog classifications are not mislabeled as individual research papers.': '每個歸屬都註明「依據［來源］」，並連結到其論文或目錄。目錄分類不會被誤標為個別的研究論文。',
      'Different parent names alone do not prove conflict. For pairs of study trees, the atlas compares clades restricted to at least three identical sampled language IDs. Crossing, non-nested clades are marked as topologically incompatible.': '僅上位名稱不同並不能證明存在衝突。對於每對研究譜系樹，圖譜只比較至少有三個相同語言樣本 ID 的分支。相互交叉、不相巢套的分支被標為拓撲上互不相容。',
      'Different sampling, unresolved polytomies and repeated mappings of different local varieties are not, by themselves, evidence of conflicting ancestry. Repeated or nested tip IDs are excluded from automatic conflict comparison.': '抽樣不同、未解決的多分叉以及不同地方變體的重複對應，本身都不構成親緣關係衝突的證據。重複或巢套的末端 ID 不參與自動衝突比較。',
      'A conflicting summary topology does not establish which scientific claim is correct. Posterior uncertainty and all analyses within each paper have not been reviewed.': '彙總拓撲的衝突並不能確定哪一種科學主張正確。後驗不確定性以及各論文中的全部分析均未經審查。',
